sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant User as User / Dashboard / KFP SDK
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant DSPO as DSPO controller-manager
    participant DB as MariaDB / MySQL<br/>3306/TCP
    participant S3 as Object storage<br/>9000 or 443/TCP
    participant Router as OpenShift Router<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant KRP as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS
    participant API as KFP API server<br/>8888 HTTP / 8887 gRPC
    participant WFC as Argo workflow controller
    participant Pods as Driver / launcher pods<br/>(v2_component=true)
    participant MLMD as MLMD gRPC<br/>8080/TCP
    participant PA as Persistence agent
    participant Webhook as ds-pipeline-webhook<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Prom as Prometheus<br/>redhat-ods-monitoring

    Note over User,DSPO: Flow 1: DSPA reconciliation
    User->>K8s: Create DSPA<br/>TLS 1.2+, user bearer token
    DSPO->>K8s: Watch DSPA, apply rendered templates<br/>TLS 1.2+, SA token
    DSPO->>DB: Health check (MySQL)<br/>TLS optional (default off), DB password Secret
    DSPO->>S3: Bucket health check<br/>TLS when secure, S3 keys
    DSPO->>K8s: Update DSPA status<br/>SA token

    Note over User,PA: Flow 2: User submits a pipeline run
    User->>Router: HTTPS 443, Route ds-pipeline-dspa<br/>Bearer token
    Router->>KRP: Reencrypt TLS (service-ca) 8443<br/>Bearer token
    KRP->>K8s: TokenReview + SubjectAccessReview<br/>datasciencepipelinesapplications/api
    K8s-->>KRP: Allowed
    KRP->>API: HTTP 8888 (service-ca TLS if podToPodTLS)<br/>no auth
    API->>DB: Persist run metadata (MySQL 3306)<br/>DB password
    API->>K8s: Create Argo Workflow<br/>ds-pipeline SA
    WFC->>K8s: Create workflow pods<br/>workflow-controller SA
    Pods->>API: gRPC 8887 / HTTP 8888<br/>no auth (NetworkPolicy only)
    Pods->>MLMD: gRPC 8080<br/>no auth (NetworkPolicy only)
    Pods->>S3: Artifact I/O<br/>S3 keys
    PA->>API: Sync workflow state 8888/8887<br/>SA token
    API-->>KRP: Response
    KRP-->>Router: Response
    Router-->>User: JSON response

    Note over User,Webhook: Flow 3: PipelineVersion admission (kubernetes pipeline store)
    User->>K8s: Create PipelineVersion<br/>Bearer
    K8s->>Webhook: POST /webhooks/mutate-pipelineversion, validate-pipelineversion<br/>service-ca TLS, failurePolicy Fail
    Webhook-->>K8s: Admission response

    Note over DSPO,Prom: Flow 4: Operator metrics scraping
    Prom->>DSPO: GET /metrics 8443/TCP HTTPS<br/>Bearer + TokenReview/SAR (metrics-reader)
    DSPO-->>Prom: Metrics
